1
00:00:00,093 --> 00:00:02,433
(Amy:)I think you'd be smart
enough to see that, too.

2
00:00:05,398 --> 00:00:06,778
(Howard:)Okay.

3
00:00:07,534 --> 00:00:09,744
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry I gave you such a hard
time, I just had to be sure.

4
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,920
(Raj:)It's pretty exciting that NASA
wants to send Howard back up.

5
00:00:16,977 --> 00:00:18,647
(Bermadette:)Yeah, exciting.

6
00:00:19,479 --> 00:00:20,819
(Bermadette:)Can I ask you something?

7
00:00:20,981 --> 00:00:22,251
(Penny:)Course.

8
00:00:22,382 --> 00:00:24,592
(Bernadette:)He hated that entire experience.

9
00:00:24,751 --> 00:00:26,061
(Bernadette:)Does it make me an awful wife

10
00:00:26,219 --> 00:00:27,819
(Bernadette:)if I don't think he
should do it again?

11
00:00:27,988 --> 00:00:29,258
(Raj:)Not at all.

12
00:00:29,422 --> 00:00:32,492
(Raj:)He's forgotten how miserable he was
the entire time he was up there.

13
00:00:32,659 --> 00:00:36,339
(Raj:)It's like me in those moments
when I miss India.

14
00:00:37,297 --> 00:00:38,397
(Bernadette:)So you'll talk to him?

15
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:39,445
(Raj:)Why me?

16
00:00:39,566 --> 00:00:41,736
(Bernadette:)I'm his wife,
I don't want to ruin it for him.

17
00:00:41,902 --> 00:00:44,642
(Raj:)That's the dynamic. I'm the
fun one, you're the buzzkill.

18
00:00:44,671 --> 00:00:46,911
(Bernadette:)Since when am I the buzzkill?

19
00:00:47,674 --> 00:00:49,744
(Raj:)-Do you think this is cool?
-No, I think it's stupid.

20
00:00:49,910 --> 00:00:51,120
Aha!

21
00:00:53,179 --> 00:00:59,019
(Bernadette:)You're right, it's great.

